<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">

{{> "head" }}

<body>

{{> "overlayNoise" }}

{{> "adLeaderboard" }}

{{> "navbar" }}

{{> "adLhsScrollingPage" }}
{{> "adRhsScrollingPage" }}

<main class="container">

	<div class="ve-flex no-print">
		<div class="form-group ve-col-2-4 ve-mr-2">
			<label for="race">种族</label>
			<select class="ve-form-control form-inline" id="race" disabled><option>加载中...</option></select>
		</div>

		<div class="form-group ve-col-2-4 ve-mr-2">
			<label for="cha">魅力调整值</label>
			<select class="ve-form-control form-inline" id="cha" disabled><option>加载中...</option></select>
		</div>

		<div class="form-group ve-col-2-4 ve-mr-2">
			<label for="race">背景</label>
			<select class="ve-form-control form-inline" id="background" disabled><option>加载中...</option></select>
		</div>

		<div class="form-group ve-col-2-4 ve-mr-2">
			<label for="race">职业</label>
			<select class="ve-form-control form-inline" id="class" disabled><option>加载中...</option></select>
		</div>

		<div class="form-group ve-col-2-4">
			<label for="age"><i>年龄</i></label>
			<select class="ve-form-control form-inline" id="age" disabled><option>加载中...</option></select>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="ve-flex no-print">
		<div class="form-group ve-col-12">
			<button class="ve-btn ve-btn-default" onclick="pRoll()">生成</button>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="ve-flex-col no-print ve-py-0 ve-px-5">
		<p>这个生成器是基于<a href="#" id="xge_link">《姗纳萨的万事指南》</a>第61-73页的规则和表格。</p>
		<p><i>意：以斜体显示所产生的文本内容是为了让使用变得更容易和快速，它们并不对应原本生成器中的任何表格。随你喜好忽视它们。</i></p>
	</div>

	<hr class="life__output" style="display: none; background: transparent">
	<div class="ve-flex-col life__output night__shadow-big ve-hidden">
		<div class="wrp-sect-head"><h4>双亲</h4><button class="ve-btn ve-btn-xs ve-btn-default no-print" onclick="pSectParents()">重骰</button></div>
		<p id="parents"></p>
	</div>
	<div class="ve-flex-col life__output night__shadow-big ve-hidden">
		<div class="wrp-sect-head"><h4>出生地</h4><button class="ve-btn ve-btn-xs ve-btn-default no-print" onclick="sectBirthplace()">重骰</button></div>
		<p id="birthplace"></p>
	</div>
	<div class="ve-flex-col life__output night__shadow-big ve-hidden">
		<div class="wrp-sect-head"><h4>兄弟姊妹</h4><button class="ve-btn ve-btn-xs ve-btn-default no-print" onclick="pSectSiblings()">重骰</button></div>
		<p id="siblings"></p>
	</div>
	<div class="ve-flex-col life__output night__shadow-big ve-hidden">
		<div class="wrp-sect-head"><h4>家族和朋友</h4><button class="ve-btn ve-btn-xs ve-btn-default no-print" onclick="sectFamily()">重骰</button></div>
		<p id="family"></p>
	</div>
	<div class="ve-flex-col life__output night__shadow-big ve-hidden">
		<div class="wrp-sect-head"><h4>个人抉择</h4><button class="ve-btn ve-btn-xs ve-btn-default no-print" onclick="sectPersonalDecisions()">重骰</button></div>
		<p id="personal"></p>
	</div>
	<div class="ve-flex-col life__output night__shadow-big ve-hidden">
		<div class="wrp-sect-head"><h4>职业训练</h4><button class="ve-btn ve-btn-xs ve-btn-default no-print" onclick="sectClassTraining()">重骰</button></div>
		<p id="clss"></p>
	</div>
	<div class="ve-flex-col life__output night__shadow-big ve-hidden">
		<div class="wrp-sect-head"><h4>人生大事</h4><button class="ve-btn ve-btn-xs ve-btn-default no-print" onclick="sectLifeEvents()">重骰</button></div>
		<p id="events"></p>
	</div>
</main>

{{> "footer" }}

{{> "adFooter" }}

{{> "scripts" }}

</body>
</html>
